      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "These guys are the Electricians who actually do the work there are no middlemen. They were the first to contact me via phone & talk about my requirements. There was very good communication from Gary over the phone as to when they would start & some advice on which inverter suited my needs. We settled on Fronius Gen24 for our 13KW system as it had extended warranty & backup power with battery option if required down the track. They were considerably cheaper than other quotes I received for the exact same brand Inverter & Panels. They showed up on the day & time as promised & had the whole job completed in half a day. They left the site tidy & took all packaging with them. I highly recommend these guys. I have given their contact to my friends who are looking for Solar. They organized the meter reconfiguration for Solar feed in with Energex. There was nothing for me to do after they left the site. Meter was reconfigured within a week by Energex & Alinta. System has been running great since installation with no issues. Very Happy with their work.",
